{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12170","headline":"寻华山云台观道士 · 钱起","name":"寻华山云台观道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋日西山明，胜趣引孤策。\n桃源数曲尽，洞口两岸坼。\n还从罔象来，忽得仙灵宅。\n霓裳谁之子，霞酌能止客。\n残阳在翠微，携手更登历。\n林行拂烟雨，溪望乱金碧。\n飞鸟下天窗，褭松际云壁。\n稍寻玄踪远，宛入寥天寂。\n愿言葛仙翁，终年链玉液。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}